{"1419850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Saleblazers", "steam_appid": 1419850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Saleblazers</i></strong> is an adventure shopkeeping survival game for 1-8 players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive a Dangerous Fantasy World as a Shopkeeper</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re a humble shopkeeper trying to live a peaceful new life, finding yourself surrounded by warring factions and dangerous creatures. Will you be able to carve out a new home for yourself and your customers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/c92a7d19ab937a3d8bcbfc6a04f91ff8.poster.avif?t=1784244981\" width=960 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/c92a7d19ab937a3d8bcbfc6a04f91ff8.webm?t=1784244981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/c92a7d19ab937a3d8bcbfc6a04f91ff8.mp4?t=1784244981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat Physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use heavy-hitting melee and ranged attacks to knock enemies down!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/b8115b0645be6242957607522e15e4e3.poster.avif?t=1784244981\" width=960 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/b8115b0645be6242957607522e15e4e3.webm?t=1784244981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/b8115b0645be6242957607522e15e4e3.mp4?t=1784244981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Living World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs will react to every action inside your shop and out. Commit too many crimes, and they'll even call on the police to take you to jail!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/73aa597789d7e86b8442e3e9f20ff91d.poster.avif?t=1784244981\" width=960 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/73aa597789d7e86b8442e3e9f20ff91d.webm?t=1784244981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/73aa597789d7e86b8442e3e9f20ff91d.mp4?t=1784244981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated server support (see Steam Community guide for details).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a Knight, Gunslinger, or Mage with all sorts of item builds to explore!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive world with many handcrafted villages to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell anything.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPCs dynamically react to your actions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use anything as a weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and run multiple shops across the island. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire employees to run your store for you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wire up electric items for powerful late-game items such as self-checkout machines or turrets. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather, fish, farm, craft, buy, or loot to stock your shelves.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Verified on Steam Deck!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/eef7db98e4a2b276109d1f57e0ee3db8.poster.avif?t=1784244981\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/eef7db98e4a2b276109d1f57e0ee3db8.webm?t=1784244981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/eef7db98e4a2b276109d1f57e0ee3db8.mp4?t=1784244981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Saleblazers</i></strong> is an adventure shopkeeping survival game for 1-8 players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive a Dangerous Fantasy World as a Shopkeeper</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re a humble shopkeeper trying to live a peaceful new life, finding yourself surrounded by warring factions and dangerous creatures. Will you be able to carve out a new home for yourself and your customers?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/c92a7d19ab937a3d8bcbfc6a04f91ff8.poster.avif?t=1784244981\" width=960 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/c92a7d19ab937a3d8bcbfc6a04f91ff8.webm?t=1784244981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1419850/extras/c92a7d19ab937a3d8bcbfc6a04f91ff8.mp4?t=1784244981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat Physics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use heavy-hitting melee and ranged